        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Lost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sometimes, to find your way out, you first need to get lost.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Lost is an atmospheric first-person adventure set inside a fractured digital simulation, where you play as a consciousness trapped within fragments of memories and glitches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark corridors, empty apartments, and distorted forests. Find keys, unlock doors, read notes, and piece together the story to discover who you are and why you’re here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies, no shooting, and no complex puzzles — just exploration, atmosphere, and deep immersion in a digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEW  Split-Screen Co-Op Mode Now Available! You can now explore Bit Lost in a special split-screen co-op mode. Grab a friend — one on keyboard &amp; mouse, the other on gamepad — and dive into a short, mysterious scenario featuring: Light puzzle-solving A few moments of fun And a final choice that only one can make. Try it together — a fresh perspective awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815120/extras/0f2a36957f1747f5a55cd50566f8683a.avif?t=1759362525\" width=1600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and discover the world through objects and notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric locations with a unique style and mood</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storytelling through environment and found writings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm, unhurried gameplay without stress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entirely created solo with care and attention to detail</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Lost is a solo project and currently a short experience. Your feedback and ideas are incredibly important to me — they will help make the game better and guide its future development. Creating this kind of atmosphere alone is challenging, especially with limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help me escape this digital simulation, and in return, I’ll offer you a unique journey deep into consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to dive into this mysterious world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download Bit Lost now and start your journey. Your opinion truly matters — become part of this story’s creation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815120/extras/ed6758786113ad2c06620eaac6879bc5.poster.avif?t=1759362525\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815120/extras/ed6758786113ad2c06620eaac6879bc5.webm?t=1759362525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815120/extras/ed6758786113ad2c06620eaac6879bc5.mp4?t=1759362525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Lost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sometimes, to find your way out, you first need to get lost.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Lost is an atmospheric first-person adventure set inside a fractured digital simulation, where you play as a consciousness trapped within fragments of memories and glitches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark corridors, empty apartments, and distorted forests. Find keys, unlock doors, read notes, and piece together the story to discover who you are and why you’re here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies, no shooting, and no complex puzzles — just exploration, atmosphere, and deep immersion in a digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEW  Split-Screen Co-Op Mode Now Available! You can now explore Bit Lost in a special split-screen co-op mode. Grab a friend — one on keyboard &amp; mouse, the other on gamepad — and dive into a short, mysterious scenario featuring: Light puzzle-solving A few moments of fun And a final choice that only one can make. Try it together — a fresh perspective awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815120/extras/0f2a36957f1747f5a55cd50566f8683a.avif?t=1759362525\" width=1600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and discover the world through objects and notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric locations with a unique style and mood</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storytelling through environment and found writings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm, unhurried gameplay without stress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entirely created solo with care and attention to detail</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Lost is a solo project and currently a short experience. Your feedback and ideas are incredibly important to me — they will help make the game better and guide its future development. Creating this kind of atmosphere alone is challenging, especially with limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help me escape this digital simulation, and in return, I’ll offer you a unique journey deep into consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to dive into this mysterious world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download Bit Lost now and start your journey. Your opinion truly matters — become part of this story’s creation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815120/extras/ed6758786113ad2c06620eaac6879bc5.poster.avif?t=1759362525\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815120/extras/ed6758786113ad2c06620eaac6879bc5.webm?t=1759362525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815120/extras/ed6758786113ad2c06620eaac6879bc5.mp4?t=1759362525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
